      "method": "Native CAD bounds and explicit manufacturer dimensional/photo reconstruction; no source scaling. Unknown placement, package differences and aperture/pixelaspect conflicts remain recorded.",
      "notes": "No hardware-fit or browser/WebGL acceptance is implied by the retained CAD or CPU geometry checks. Factory display execution is independently recorded in product limitations; a model screen only shows the actual emulator framebuffer. Native CAD contains1031 controller components and21 adapter components; both assemblies retained with native coordinates. Source files do not establish enclosure mounting; alignment and internal clearances remain estimates. Enclosure variants use distinct192.6×123.5×11.7,205×140.5×12 or250.2×169×12mm dimensions. Roundedcorners, camera/port/speakeropenings, fasteners and packageextras are not yet reconstructed. Pixelplane preserves720:1280 or800:1280 aspect inside source aperture; no anisotropic source/model scaling or framebufferstretch. Portrait view is a rigid orientation choice. No GPIO button hotspot is invented from uncalibrated internalCAD. Genuine touch/BOOT controls are available; no DSI framebuffer support is claimed."
